(6236284, 920965, 20799, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top picks. Maybe because it reminds me of my grandmother but also because it''s such a well told story. People might nitpick about the contrast and the chairs... but they probably won''t notice the detail about her feet being out of her shoes. Amazing photo for me, should be in the top 3.</td>', 'This was one of my top picks. Maybe because it reminds me of my grandmother but also because it''s such a well told story. People might nitpick about the contrast and the chairs... but they probably won''t notice the detail about her feet being out of her shoes. Amazing photo for me, should be in the top 3.', '2010-11-28 16:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236286, 921365, 20799, '<td valign="top">A captured moment not easy to decode... and that''s what makes the magic for me here. You''ve got a 9 from me.</td>', 'A captured moment not easy to decode... and that''s what makes the magic for me here. You''ve got a 9 from me.', '2010-11-28 16:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
