(6238748, 921669, 112972, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot, but to most people it may not be clear that it was taken at night, especially since sepia tones were used and no light sources are to be seen in the background.  Great processing and wonderful shot overall.  It would have scored much higher had there been clear indications that this was in fact taken at night and it is not the post-processing that has achieved this.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-30 15:14:01.</i></td>', 'I like this image a lot, but to most people it may not be clear that it was taken at night, especially since sepia tones were used and no light sources are to be seen in the background.  Great processing and wonderful shot overall.  It would have scored much higher had there been clear indications that this was in fact taken at night and it is not the post-processing that has achieved this.', '2010-11-30 12:47:58.000000', '2011-07-30 16:14:01.000000', 1),
(6238837, 921596, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well it''s an awesome story. Not a fan of the overdone vignette here (subtler would have made it merely a feature, not a distraction/major element) but the scene still is awesome. Two birds performed as well. 9</td>', 'Well it''s an awesome story. Not a fan of the overdone vignette here (subtler would have made it merely a feature, not a distraction/major element) but the scene still is awesome. Two birds performed as well. 9', '2010-11-30 14:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6238839, 921593, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. I know this feeling far too well, but it''s more like I fell asleep on the train, missed my stop and had to wait for hours. The clarity is impressive. What''s interesting is the head and chest are see-through, yet the hands aren''t. Great shot. Bumped to 10. Favorite of the challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'This is awesome. I know this feeling far too well, but it''s more like I fell asleep on the train, missed my stop and had to wait for hours. The clarity is impressive. What''s interesting is the head and chest are see-through, yet the hands aren''t. Great shot. Bumped to 10. Favorite of the challenge. Good luck.', '2010-11-30 14:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6238873, 920965, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice expressiveness! If the furniture didn''t appear to be made of plastic in the full-size version, I could believe this was an antique image. How would it look in sepia?</td>', 'Nice expressiveness! If the furniture didn''t appear to be made of plastic in the full-size version, I could believe this was an antique image. How would it look in sepia?', '2010-11-30 15:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239130, 921651, 122591, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but the title sort of ruined it for me. Still, trying not to let that affect my vote...</td>', 'Nice picture, but the title sort of ruined it for me. Still, trying not to let that affect my vote...', '2010-11-30 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239133, 921574, 122591, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit overprocessed, too much sharpening or something. Very visible on her fingers as well as around the lights in the background.</td>', 'Seems a bit overprocessed, too much sharpening or something. Very visible on her fingers as well as around the lights in the background.', '2010-11-30 19:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239136, 921559, 122591, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how this is processed, but something about her skin just looks very unnatural. Some people will probably like that, but I don''t.</td>', 'I don''t know how this is processed, but something about her skin just looks very unnatural. Some people will probably like that, but I don''t.', '2010-11-30 19:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239142, 921648, 50864, '<td valign="top">Great image. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Great image. One of my favorites.', '2010-11-30 19:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239146, 921648, 122591, '<td valign="top">This is so blurry I can''t really figure out what''s going on. Is it a body? A face? A lawnmower? Sorry, but this doesn''t really do anything for me.</td>', 'This is so blurry I can''t really figure out what''s going on. Is it a body? A face? A lawnmower? Sorry, but this doesn''t really do anything for me.', '2010-11-30 19:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239149, 921573, 122591, '<td valign="top">I voted this down because I felt it didn''t meet the challenge, being a picture of another portrait. Still, it has something enigmatic over it that I''d love to see in another challenge.</td>', 'I voted this down because I felt it didn''t meet the challenge, being a picture of another portrait. Still, it has something enigmatic over it that I''d love to see in another challenge.', '2010-11-30 19:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239152, 921336, 122591, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it is the camera or the post processing, but the image quality is quite low and the colors are really blurred. A cute motive but the technical quality pulls it down.</td>', 'I don''t know if it is the camera or the post processing, but the image quality is quite low and the colors are really blurred. A cute motive but the technical quality pulls it down.', '2010-11-30 19:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239154, 921393, 122591, '<td valign="top">Too much motion blur going on for my taste. The context is also a bit limited, so I don''t really understand what the picture is trying to say.</td>', 'Too much motion blur going on for my taste. The context is also a bit limited, so I don''t really understand what the picture is trying to say.', '2010-11-30 19:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
